			<tr><td><a href="img/neko023.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/neko023.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/mono/neko/img/neko023.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
